# 30. EXAM TRAPS

> **Threat hunting = incident response**

False.

> **Threat hunting only searches for known malware hashes**

False.

> **Every anomaly is an attack**

False.

> **IOC hunting is sufficient**

False.

> **Threat hunting is completely automated**

False.

Human reasoning and context are important.

